  (text "5 V supply from the opener +24 V terminal (unregulated, may read ~30-34 V with no load: measure it)." (at 30.48 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c1665a6b-0884-4899-8362-0a2e2484bcb2))
  (text "U5: RECOM R-78E5.0-0.5, 7-28 V in, 5 V 0.5 A, LM7805 pinout, ~90% efficient. D8 drops 10 V so ~34 V no-load becomes ~24 V." (at 30.48 186.69 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 908d3c49-3a7a-4c3b-9d38-d6823c870ff8))
  (text "F1 limits a fault. D5 reverse polarity. D6 clamps spikes at U5 input. D7 stops USB 5 V feeding back. Load ~20 mA avg, ~60 mA peak." (at 30.48 189.23 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 548be88b-03ac-4f68-9876-bb9fd15cc770))
  (text "XIAO_5V goes to the XIAO 5V (VBUS) pin on the main sheet." (at 30.48 191.77 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b522f68f-ea7b-46be-9783-91d10fc194db))
